lgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AJ3vUhc2-2sQ7kNvwGikn9m&_nc_oc=AdoJAWewuitZpZV9dfUNi3sSBYZdr6jdhEsu1uizyCpj4R4vWIPatpCrzxx5Y1uGXxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR10bXdeWE2Zut91V7MoZDTco7dZzDXKPrLqJ4Dia9pag&oe=6AFF2B2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=enAe_6N2MYIQ7kNvwHFkGBm&_nc_oc=Ado8spgzzzjvrCbh3icGbvX0cwEjnQQB5_0-1VuxHgmItdkOokcXN88ZN6owlOU8680&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXmorPciSJtSKfKjkwcHJj4yA